The message it gave you about "a more primitive world" means you are on the
rogue level.  Rogue was an ancient game, which even I played a couple different
versions of, which was one of the ancestors of hack and Nethack and all other
related games.  When you got your version of Nethack, you should have gotten a
history file with it, most likely named something like HISTORY.  I don't know
if anyone still plays rogue, but it was pretty neat, considering there were
only 26 monsters.  More Thanx to the dev team for making the rogue level in 
3.1.3 look like an actual rogue screen -- different symbols for traps and all.

